Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hanami, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That octopus guy, he currently thinks that\Nboth our domains are pushing for control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my goal is different from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll open up a small hole in\Nthe barrier of this domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hole that I entered through\Nhas already been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exiting is much harder than entering,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think I can still\Nopen a hole large enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for someone to pass\Nthrough for a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The edge of his domain's beneath my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell since I\Ntouched it when I entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all three of you jump in at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't have any\Nplans for staying behind here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm risking my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't intend to throw it away.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.76,0:00:49.76,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fnRagnar\fs60\pos(960,800)\b1}Episode 39\N{\fs70}Fluctuations II
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They faced an enemy that\Nunderstood language,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he conveyed his intent\Nin an indirect way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they put their trust\Nin the Grade One Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.33,0:01:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The previously excluded possibility of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escaping the Domain became\Nan option once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.53,0:01:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're bolstering their\Ndefense of the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just groups them up for me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.35,0:01:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He figured it out, but it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to Pushy Bureau's feet now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.95,0:01:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who had inherited the\Ncurse of the Zenin clan from birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:02:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the one who could not completely cast\Noff that curse they both stood in witness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the one who left it all behind now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,manifested in raw flesh and taking action
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh who's that a person
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sorcerer they brought
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a new sorcerer instead\Nof escaping when they
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had the chance hmm he's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.95,0:02:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fast he was just in midair
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's not all either\Nwhat's with his strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.33,0:02:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel any cursed energy from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I just lose a\Ncontest of pure strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro, it's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hole's been sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, it\Njust figured out our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it won't let us open\Na hole as easily again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toji...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny Ogami's seance technique\Nstill continued after her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her summoning of the dead should\Nhave ceased once her grandson,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the vessel, ran out of cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there was no cursed\Nenergy in the grandson's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soul that was overwritten\Nby Toji Zenon's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his body never expended\Ncursed energy either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her technique had lost its\Nchance to terminate him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the compounding irregularities now\Nleft her technique running rampant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toji Zenin was currently\Nfighting as directed by
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his instincts until his\Nvessel ultimately broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had become a murder machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.49,0:03:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man has no cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not worth my attention, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.03,0:04:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His fangs were constantly\Ndirected toward the strongest one.
