Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.03,0:07:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:07:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-oh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro, can you hold\Nout a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're placing our bets on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's smashing Playful\NCloud against itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's changing in shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he sharpening it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I going to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Against a human with no cursed energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel that young\Nboy's domain weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.91,0:09:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can regain my cat-miss attack\Neffect, I can kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to buy time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can limitate too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I need to repeat myself again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.25,0:10:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Domain's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seriously exercised that\Noctopus all by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.31,0:10:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Fushiguro hadn't shown up, we all\Nwould have been wiped out for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.73,0:10:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, problems still remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.75,0:10:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he an ally or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I get outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His speed is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be faster than Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.61,0:11:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've passed on, Dagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. Oh, boy, you're kidding,\Nright? This one's another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stronger leave the rest to me old\Nfriend stronger than Dagon our
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,souls will reincarnate even\Nwithout relying on human beings
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let us meet again in the wasteland
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a century from
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now now then
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.13,0:12:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:12:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Third one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.61,0:13:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone has released Sukuna's\Nfinger somewhere in Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry, Nanako.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.47,0:13:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fingers might draw cursed spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.45,0:13:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, come out, Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how many fingers did you feed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't tell you. Mimiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so, then die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The markings haven't disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.97,0:14:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was an unexpected turn of\Nevents, but I'll make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About Yuji Itadori, even if\Nhe consumed all 20 fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he probably still wouldn't lose\Ncontrol of his body to Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's only if he consumes one finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at a time for 20\Nconsecutive days in a row?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he took intent at once, his\Nbody couldn't adapt fast enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sukuna would take control even if\Nit were only a temporary situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Sukuna.
