Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fed him all ten fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means by now there should be\Nat least fifteen inside Yuji Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.43,0:15:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're both still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably due to one of their techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But given how scared they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt they can use it repeatedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not waste my time any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.95,0:15:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His strength is of a different\Nkind than even Satoru Gojo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's overwhelmingly evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear that any move we make now\Nmight result in sudden death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe. It's okay. Breathe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.97,0:16:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't kill us for that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hold your heads quite high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.81,0:16:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you believe taking\None knee was enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bows that bear most hang lowest, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess you guys\Nare pretty lightweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You kids first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.57,0:17:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted to speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you want to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you a finger's worth of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.43,0:17:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Below us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.21,0:17:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a man in monk's robes,\Nwith stitches across his forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.65,0:17:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And also, please free Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Code?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.83,0:17:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this Satoru Gojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's strong, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best friend I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we had a big fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.49,0:18:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't spoken since.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.73,0:18:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never forgive Satoru Gojo for\Nkilling Geto for as long as we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.71,0:18:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we were okay with\Nleaving things as they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, Satoru Gojo was\NKeto's one and only best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.41,0:18:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make you regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the location of one\Nother finger you can have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you kill that man for us in\Nexchange, we'll tell you where it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:18:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your heads up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe go! Maybe go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think a measly one or two fingers would\Ngrant you the right to order me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.65,0:19:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way I can't! Imiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How insulting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna! Die! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A phone with some kind\Nof photography device.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably just some type of ability to\Nmanipulate the photographed subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.29,0:20:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, the cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your turn to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.21,0:20:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her objective was\Nbringing you back, Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.31,0:20:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just wanted your complete revival.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, Itadori is\Nhelpless to counter you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.79,0:20:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that is only temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.05,0:20:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm sure you know\Nthat better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.71,0:20:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if Sukuna's reverse curse technique\Nis capable of healing others as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.37,0:20:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it can't do anything about\Nthe shape of a soul once
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.23,0:20:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's been changed by Mahito's\Nidle transfiguration.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't that he didn't want\Nto forge a pact way back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.05,0:20:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was that he couldn't forge a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:20:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see only one way forward for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forge a pact with Yuji\NTodori before he returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.31,0:21:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pact to grant you perpetual\Nauthority over his body.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.59,0:21:05.35,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\an7\pos(0,-13)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&H050505&}m 572.65 0 l 1401.37 0 1401.37 117.84 572.65 117.84 566.17 60.54
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.59,0:21:05.35,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fnArial\fs99\c&H1D261E&\pos(995,62)\b1}NOTICE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.47,0:21:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this moment, Shibuya is\Ncrawling with Itadori's allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could use them as\Nleverage if you wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.41,0:21:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have already devised plans of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.27,0:21:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know, when I look at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you cursed\Nspirits are so desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.49,0:21:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give you a reward as a token\Nof appreciation for the fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you manage to land\Neven a single blow on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll work under you for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.95,0:21:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to begin, how about I\Nslaughter every human in Shibuya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.63,0:21:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the exception of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.77,0:22:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be true to your word?
